{"video": "cebola", "titulo": "Por que a cebola faz chorar?", "fps": 30, "durationInFrames": 1800, "durationSeconds": 60.0, "engine": "kokoro", "voz": {"estilo": "documentario", "ritmo": 1.0}, "scenes": [{"id": "gancho", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 86, "lines": [{"text": "Por que a cebola faz a gente chorar?", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 74, "words": [{"text": "Por", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 8}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 8, "endFrame": 14}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 14, "endFrame": 20}, {"text": "cebola", "startFrame": 20, "endFrame": 33}, {"text": "faz", "startFrame": 33, "endFrame": 43}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 43, "endFrame": 45}, {"text": "gente", "startFrame": 45, "endFrame": 63}, {"text": "chorar?", "startFrame": 63, "endFrame": 74}]}]}, {"id": "armadilha", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 86, "endFrame": 422, "lines": [{"text": "Ela não te faz chorar porque toca sertanejo… e sim porque esconde uma armadilha química!", "startFrame": 98, "endFrame": 259, "words": [{"text": "Ela", "startFrame": 98, "endFrame": 105}, {"text": "não", "startFrame": 105, "endFrame": 114}, {"text": "te", "startFrame": 114, "endFrame": 121}, {"text": "faz", "startFrame": 121, "endFrame": 124}, {"text": "chorar", "startFrame": 124, "endFrame": 134}, {"text": "porque", "startFrame": 134, "endFrame": 150}, {"text": "toca", "startFrame": 150, "endFrame": 159}, {"text": "sertanejo…", "startFrame": 159, "endFrame": 177}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 185, "endFrame": 188}, {"text": "sim", "startFrame": 188, "endFrame": 195}, {"text": "porque", "startFrame": 195, "endFrame": 202}, {"text": "esconde", "startFrame": 202, "endFrame": 215}, {"text": "uma", "startFrame": 215, "endFrame": 224}, {"text": "armadilha", "startFrame": 224, "endFrame": 248}, {"text": "química!", "startFrame": 248, "endFrame": 259}]}, {"text": "Inteira, ela guarda os ingredientes separadinhos, cada um no seu cantinho.", "startFrame": 271, "endFrame": 410, "words": [{"text": "Inteira,", "startFrame": 271, "endFrame": 289}, {"text": "ela", "startFrame": 291, "endFrame": 299}, {"text": "guarda", "startFrame": 299, "endFrame": 310}, {"text": "os", "startFrame": 310, "endFrame": 315}, {"text": "ingredientes", "startFrame": 315, "endFrame": 340}, {"text": "separadinhos,", "startFrame": 340, "endFrame": 361}, {"text": "cada", "startFrame": 367, "endFrame": 374}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 374, "endFrame": 383}, {"text": "no", "startFrame": 383, "endFrame": 386}, {"text": "seu", "startFrame": 386, "endFrame": 391}, {"text": "cantinho.", "startFrame": 391, "endFrame": 410}]}]}, {"id": "corte", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 422, "endFrame": 562, "lines": [{"text": "Mas quando a faca corta, as células se rompem… e tudo se mistura!", "startFrame": 434, "endFrame": 550, "words": [{"text": "Mas", "startFrame": 434, "endFrame": 440}, {"text": "quando", "startFrame": 440, "endFrame": 449}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 449, "endFrame": 451}, {"text": "faca", "startFrame": 451, "endFrame": 457}, {"text": "corta,", "startFrame": 457, "endFrame": 470}, {"text": "as", "startFrame": 476, "endFrame": 482}, {"text": "células", "startFrame": 482, "endFrame": 498}, {"text": "se", "startFrame": 498, "endFrame": 502}, {"text": "rompem…", "startFrame": 502, "endFrame": 517}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 520, "endFrame": 524}, {"text": "tudo", "startFrame": 524, "endFrame": 529}, {"text": "se", "startFrame": 529, "endFrame": 537}, {"text": "mistura!", "startFrame": 537, "endFrame": 550}]}]}, {"id": "gas", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 562, "endFrame": 769, "lines": [{"text": "Uma enzima transforma essa mistura num gás invisível…", "startFrame": 574, "endFrame": 680, "words": [{"text": "Uma", "startFrame": 574, "endFrame": 581}, {"text": "enzima", "startFrame": 581, "endFrame": 594}, {"text": "transforma", "startFrame": 594, "endFrame": 615}, {"text": "essa", "startFrame": 619, "endFrame": 626}, {"text": "mistura", "startFrame": 626, "endFrame": 645}, {"text": "num", "startFrame": 645, "endFrame": 649}, {"text": "gás", "startFrame": 649, "endFrame": 657}, {"text": "invisível…", "startFrame": 657, "endFrame": 680}]}, {"text": "que voa direto pros seus olhos!", "startFrame": 692, "endFrame": 757, "words": [{"text": "que", "startFrame": 692, "endFrame": 698}, {"text": "voa", "startFrame": 698, "endFrame": 707}, {"text": "direto", "startFrame": 707, "endFrame": 723}, {"text": "pros", "startFrame": 723, "endFrame": 735}, {"text": "seus", "startFrame": 735, "endFrame": 746}, {"text": "olhos!", "startFrame": 746, "endFrame": 757}]}]}, {"id": "olho", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 769, "endFrame": 945, "lines": [{"text": "O gás irrita os nervos do olho, e o corpo reage: solta lágrimas pra lavar tudo!", "startFrame": 781, "endFrame": 933, "words": [{"text": "O", "startFrame": 781, "endFrame": 784}, {"text": "gás", "startFrame": 784, "endFrame": 790}, {"text": "irrita", "startFrame": 790, "endFrame": 801}, {"text": "os", "startFrame": 801, "endFrame": 807}, {"text": "nervos", "startFrame": 807, "endFrame": 820}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 820, "endFrame": 824}, {"text": "olho,", "startFrame": 824, "endFrame": 833}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 839, "endFrame": 844}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 844, "endFrame": 846}, {"text": "corpo", "startFrame": 846, "endFrame": 860}, {"text": "reage:", "startFrame": 860, "endFrame": 871}, {"text": "solta", "startFrame": 874, "endFrame": 884}, {"text": "lágrimas", "startFrame": 884, "endFrame": 903}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 903, "endFrame": 911}, {"text": "lavar", "startFrame": 911, "endFrame": 920}, {"text": "tudo!", "startFrame": 920, "endFrame": 933}]}]}, {"id": "descoberta", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 945, "endFrame": 1304, "lines": [{"text": "Essa enzima só foi descoberta em 2002, por cientistas japoneses.", "startFrame": 956, "endFrame": 1106, "words": [{"text": "Essa", "startFrame": 956, "endFrame": 970}, {"text": "enzima", "startFrame": 970, "endFrame": 992}, {"text": "só", "startFrame": 992, "endFrame": 998}, {"text": "foi", "startFrame": 998, "endFrame": 1004}, {"text": "descoberta", "startFrame": 1004, "endFrame": 1038}, {"text": "em", "startFrame": 1038, "endFrame": 1045}, {"text": "2002,", "startFrame": 1045, "endFrame": 1049}, {"text": "por", "startFrame": 1055, "endFrame": 1061}, {"text": "cientistas", "startFrame": 1061, "endFrame": 1084}, {"text": "japoneses.", "startFrame": 1084, "endFrame": 1106}]}, {"text": "E a descoberta ganhou até o IgNobel, o prêmio das pesquisas que fazem rir e depois pensar!", "startFrame": 1117, "endFrame": 1292, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 1117, "endFrame": 1122}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 1122, "endFrame": 1125}, {"text": "descoberta", "startFrame": 1125, "endFrame": 1143}, {"text": "ganhou", "startFrame": 1143, "endFrame": 1157}, {"text": "até", "startFrame": 1157, "endFrame": 1165}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 1165, "endFrame": 1168}, {"text": "IgNobel,", "startFrame": 1168, "endFrame": 1183}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 1192, "endFrame": 1195}, {"text": "prêmio", "startFrame": 1195, "endFrame": 1211}, {"text": "das", "startFrame": 1211, "endFrame": 1217}, {"text": "pesquisas", "startFrame": 1217, "endFrame": 1236}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 1236, "endFrame": 1244}, {"text": "fazem", "startFrame": 1244, "endFrame": 1255}, {"text": "rir", "startFrame": 1255, "endFrame": 1262}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 1262, "endFrame": 1265}, {"text": "depois", "startFrame": 1265, "endFrame": 1277}, {"text": "pensar!", "startFrame": 1277, "endFrame": 1292}]}]}, {"id": "dicas", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 1304, "endFrame": 1561, "lines": [{"text": "Quer chorar menos? Use faca bem afiada, que estraga menos células.", "startFrame": 1316, "endFrame": 1444, "words": [{"text": "Quer", "startFrame": 1316, "endFrame": 1321}, {"text": "chorar", "startFrame": 1321, "endFrame": 1334}, {"text": "menos?", "startFrame": 1334, "endFrame": 1350}, {"text": "Use", "startFrame": 1356, "endFrame": 1365}, {"text": "faca", "startFrame": 1365, "endFrame": 1374}, {"text": "bem", "startFrame": 1374, "endFrame": 1384}, {"text": "afiada,", "startFrame": 1384, "endFrame": 1398}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 1398, "endFrame": 1405}, {"text": "estraga", "startFrame": 1405, "endFrame": 1418}, {"text": "menos", "startFrame": 1418, "endFrame": 1431}, {"text": "células.", "startFrame": 1431, "endFrame": 1444}]}, {"text": "E deixe a cebola na geladeira antes de cortar.", "startFrame": 1456, "endFrame": 1549, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 1456, "endFrame": 1461}, {"text": "deixe", "startFrame": 1461, "endFrame": 1468}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 1468, "endFrame": 1474}, {"text": "cebola", "startFrame": 1474, "endFrame": 1487}, {"text": "na", "startFrame": 1487, "endFrame": 1492}, {"text": "geladeira", "startFrame": 1492, "endFrame": 1516}, {"text": "antes", "startFrame": 1516, "endFrame": 1528}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 1528, "endFrame": 1531}, {"text": "cortar.", "startFrame": 1531, "endFrame": 1549}]}]}, {"id": "conclusao", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 1561, "endFrame": 1800, "lines": [{"text": "Resumindo: não é sofrência… é química pura!", "startFrame": 1573, "endFrame": 1657, "words": [{"text": "Resumindo:", "startFrame": 1573, "endFrame": 1596}, {"text": "não", "startFrame": 1596, "endFrame": 1609}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 1609, "endFrame": 1616}, {"text": "sofrência…", "startFrame": 1616, "endFrame": 1641}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 1644, "endFrame": 1646}, {"text": "química", "startFrame": 1646, "endFrame": 1654}, {"text": "pura!", "startFrame": 1654, "endFrame": 1657}]}, {"text": "E aí, qual comida te faz chorar? Conta aí!", "startFrame": 1669, "endFrame": 1746, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 1669, "endFrame": 1673}, {"text": "aí,", "startFrame": 1673, "endFrame": 1680}, {"text": "qual", "startFrame": 1682, "endFrame": 1688}, {"text": "comida", "startFrame": 1688, "endFrame": 1704}, {"text": "te", "startFrame": 1704, "endFrame": 1706}, {"text": "faz", "startFrame": 1706, "endFrame": 